            0.151,
            0.729,
            0.846,
            0.824
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are 3 closed boxes—one containing only red balls, the second containing only blue balls and the third containing only green balls. The boxes are labelled RED, BLUE and GREEN such that ‘no’ box has the correct label. We need to find which label goes with which box. How can this be done if we are allowed to open only one box?"
            }
          ]
